.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, PBE0-D3BJ/def2-SVP, optimisation and analytic frequencies with IR and Raman. This calculation shows the C=O stretch of a carboxylic acid at 1907.15 cm-1 (unscaled), the highest of the neutral carbonyl compounds in this set, with IR 326.15 km/mol and Raman activity 5.181.
